    "lawCode": "Add §2808-f, Pub Health L",
    "lawSection": "Public Health Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S9519A\n\nSPONSOR: SCARCELLA-SPANTON\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the public health law, in relation to establishing an\nadvanced residential health care for aging adults with medical fragility\ndemonstration program\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nTo amend the public health law, in relation to establishing an advanced\nresidential health care for aging adults with medical fragility demon-\nstration program.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 Amends public health law by adding a new section 2808-f.\n\nSection 2 establishes the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nAging adults with medical fragility require acute services that are not\nalways readily available. When these adults who are cared for by adoles-\ncent facilities age out, they are often placed in nursing homes that do\nnot have the resources necessary to deal with their complex conditions.\nThis bill would establish skilled nursing units for these adults with\nmedical fragility so that this vulnerable population has long term care\noptions designed specifically for their needs.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nThis is a new bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nMinimal.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nEffective Immediately.\n",
